er-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3627342427989\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker80","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3627342428985\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3627342428985\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker81","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3627342410614\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3627342410614\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker82","name":"Nomalalen Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 9 m long inhabits Nomalalen Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Hertford Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 8 m long inhabits Hertford Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Agripi Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 16 m long inhabits Agripi Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Shonewes Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 17 m long."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Tutham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 15 m long."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Casthovil Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 24 m long."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Totrema Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 30 m long."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Leintxe Ogre","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a proud Ogre who inhabits Leintxe hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Viguguscum Undead","legend":"Legends speak of a terrifying Undead who inhabits Viguguscum hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Athmolis Undead","legend":"Legends speak of a hungry Undead who inhabits Athmolis hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Rolis Banshee","legend":"Elders speak of a giant Banshee who inhabits Rolis hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Aelodueg Undead","legend":"Elders speak of a horrifying Undead who inhabits Aelodueg hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Nivisciale Bearded Devil","legend":"Tales speak of a proud Bearded Devil who inhabits Nivisciale hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Legizkaola Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Ielulizturism."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Smyrneron Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Euegripi Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Roman Faith."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Hondonata Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Ielulizturism."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Betaburitia Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Mendolamaga Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Tularia Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Omaiectola Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Path of Vindum."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Akros Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Atealodes Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Eiaion Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Kopolynthe Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Mannareabi Religion."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Tauliaraura Wolverines","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Thetum Rats","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Malton Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༳༻༙༦༵༷༰༔༡༰་༕༺༣༈༧༓༌༺༄༔༾༢༕་༮༺༑༯༣༪༃༵༆༴༌༑༣༲༳</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Hanagri Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀጰሠ ለቀመረበሐከፈዘፐፀአጠሐ ለወረጠ ፈአዘለሐገፈከፐፀበየአፀረሠሠሰፐፀሰሰሠ ሠረ ቀ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Corberunna Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༨༢༥༐༒༅༗༫༥༥༯༧༓༺༗༯༅༾༳༪༹༦༗༬༡༸༔ༀ༱༗༯༈༖༉༃༉༱༓༖༨༴༱༛༅༑༔༹༭༌༓༛༄༽༦༤༨༐༷་༈༯༖༿༃༦༂༌༚༱༤༐༗༶༣༇</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Corumnorium Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀገፈየሠሐነ  ሐዘደሠደፀጰዘዘ ፀ መደፐመገዘመገ ለየጸፐዐየዘወ ሀለ ለዘጠአ ፈደጰሀገከረገአዘሠሰጠሀበጠ ፈዘሐተለ ሀለበ</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Callencucus Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0a𐠪\ud802\ud802 \udc23\udc15\ud802\ud802𐠚\udc38𐠭\udc0d\ud802\ud802 \udc28𐠔𐠩\udc35\udc05\udc04 \udc2d𐠁\udc35\udc05𐠼\udc30\udc08  \ud802𐠄\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠖\udc34\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc31\udc05𐠜\udc37\udc27\udc3c𐠱\udc20\ud802𐠭\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠎\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Xeza Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⲼⳀⲶⲾ⳩ⳖⲲⳠⳃⳄⳔⳆ⳥ⳄⳆⳲⳬⳌⳫⳭⳞⳎⳭⳆ⳪Ⲽ⳥ⳔⳐⳔ⳹ⳞⳀⳀ⳧ⳀⳐ Ⳣ⳾ⳠⳫ ⳫⳌ ⳘⳠⳐⳒⲺ ⳂⳀⲺⳚⳖ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Cantiomanum Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳖⲶ⳥ ⳖⳈ⳹⳥ⳒⲲⳘ⳪⳪ⲾⲶ ⳬ  ⳀⳜ⳪ⳃⳒⳘⳄⳄⳊⲸⳤⳔⲾⳭⳭ ⳘⳤⳂ⳪⳧Ⲻ⳧ⳂⲴⳞ⳥Ⳟ⳧ⳖⳌⳚⲸ⳥⳩Ⳙ⳹ⲺⳌⲾⳌⲲⳐ⳪Ⳁ⳹ⳞⳒⳢⳬⳞⳌ⳪ⳌⲲⳎⳢ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Londaurum Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༖༇ༀ༢༳༨༓༐༉༥༃༗༉༸༊་༷༁༬༲༢༒༗༤་༻༄༠༿༢༮༴༷༇༺༷༬༇༓༒༶༻༨༴༸༙༓༊༸༔༓༓༁༥༰༚༩༂༻༵༛༛༳༦༅༈༷༪༖ༀ༦༛༠༳༷༙༥་༣་༗༮༗༮</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Dubrina Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳬⳢⳊ⳹ⳲⳞⳂⳔⳆⳬⲺⳂⳌ⳥ⳈⳬⳘⳔⲾ ⳧Ⳉ⳾Ⳍⳃ⳾ⲴⳄⳤ ⳲⳚⳁⲺⳂ⳧ⲶⳔ ⳹ⳫⲺⳀⳲⳀⳚⳀⳄⳁⳀ ⳆⳬⳚ ⳹⳥ⳫⳆⲲⳆ ⳊⳐⲴⲼ⳹Ⳟ⳧⳧ⲺⳎ⳾ⳆⳌⲶⲴ⳧ⳚⳞⳔⲴⲼⲲⳆⳜ⳩Ⳁ ⳆⲴⳠⲾⳄⳢⳲ⳾</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Lacrem Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳜⳃⳬⳊⲺⲸⳒⳲⲼ⳪ⳂⳀⳚⳭⳂ Ⳉ ⳫⳞⲸⲸⳠ⳪ⲺⳖⳄⳲⲶⳤ⳧ⳂⳎⲴ⳹Ⳣ  ⳚⳄⲾ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Linsium Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነወየፐሐዐአበቀቀደ ሐነሀበተወተ   ፐሠጸፐገፀፐፐረለተኀሐተበበኀወመተረወገለፈፀአገሰዘሀየ ጠ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Tutoma Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༁༥༫༒༓༱༌༔༘༥༚༘༨༒༰༘༂༪ༀ༖༵ༀ༤༆༧༹༼ༀ༐༒༅༪༑༗༹༄༿༶༯༨༻༶༊༢༮༡༑༠༡༻་༜༲༓༡༒༥༮༈༓༺༅༉༕༲༠༡༧༡༑༽༭༅༚༼༶༜༔༡༮༤༊༺༥༓༳༌༷༫༺༾༐་ༀ༭༙༒</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Stothambe Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐዘተፐዘገዐነወነወጸሀ ዐፀ ደፀሠሐሀጠበነጰመየ ሐደዘሐለፈሠ ገሰመሰአየፀበየበለወሀኀጠየየበረሀደየ አከጰ ፈበ</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Blescatetum Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᡭᠩᢠᡓᡠᡓᡞᢀᠵᡐᡳᠱᠪᠻᢂᠿ᠐ᡞᡳ᠀ᢁᠱᢞᠱᠩᡲᡀᡀᡍᡍᠰᢡᠾᡁᡡᢠᡀᢡ᠐ᡳᡱᢁᡯᢀᠧᢂᡙᠼᡔᠯᠵᠪᢜᠿᡰᢥᢂᡁᡏᢞ᠐ᡝᠻᠽᢞᠿ</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name